    49	- **N1 (route breadth): FAIL.** Cycle 928 consolidates only four top-level routes (angle-native theorem, Record normalization, occurrence/event rate, primitive), below the required five genuinely distinct route families, while ten in-window cycles and two quarantined packages are explicitly unswept/typing-only ([Cycle 928 note](docs/ROUTE1_SWEPT_EMPTY_TYPE_GAP_CYCLE928_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-07-28.md), lines 65–79 and 118–134).
